      "requirements": [
        "Visit modifiers, names and type parameters before the parameter lexical environment; preserve tokens because this retained caller does not supply a token visitor.",
        "Visit all parameters with InParameters set, then lower defaults only when VariablesHoistedInParameters is set. The retained dispatch admits ES2022/ESNext, satisfying the source ES2015 target guard.",
        "Rest parameters remain unchanged. Binding patterns receive one generated parameter identity and a custom initialization declaration; scalar defaults clone the identifier and compare it with void zero.",
        "Scalar default assignment target gets NoSourceMap; initializer preserves incoming flags and adds NoSourceMap/NoComments; assignment gets the parameter raw range and NoComments. The guard block gets the parameter raw range and the four source flag categories.",
        "Suspend after parameters, visit the return type, resume before the body, then end and merge. Concise-body conversion maps both return statement and block to the expression raw range.",
        "Class member names use the class pending-expression visitor; ordinary object methods use ordinary visitation. Static input blocks start their own environment; synthesized initializer blocks are not revisited."
      ],
      "limits": [
        "The architecture reference and complete context/factory premise validation remain part of readiness.",
        "Post-TypeScript type erasure is the admitted producer boundary; arbitrary API1 custom transforms are not qualified by these observations."
      ]
    },
