      "requirements": [
        "TransformationContext stores hoisted Identifier handles; the retained consumer materializes VariableDeclaration nodes with NoNestedSourceMaps and one CustomPrologue variable statement.",
        "Materialization orders function declarations, variable statement and initialization statements. The context marks hoists in parameters and initialization statements through its existing typed APIs.",
        "Compute left and right directive/function/variable spans plus right custom span before insertion. Insert custom, variable and function ranges at their respective left boundaries; deduplicate right directives against the original left directives.",
        "Preserve source/function NodeArray positions and trailing-comma state when applying the merged Vec. Reject an invalid declaration prologue sequence with TransformError.",
        "Function visitation captures the Result before ending its context and generated-name scope; return-type errors resume the suspended context before propagation."
      ],
