      "requirements": [
        "Preallocate transformed accessor private member names after heritage and before emitting constructor/member bodies.",
        "Keep source-name private cache separate from the public computed-name cache. Reserve parsed private spellings across the source file and generated private spellings across ancestor scopes.",
        "Use raw source spelling for a parsed member with parent/range provenance; emitted escaped spelling participates in the preferred base.",
        "An optimistic preferred base tries the unsuffixed full name first. On collision append a number, adding a separator only if the base does not already end in underscore.",
        "The formatted anonymous private sequence skips counts8 and13 (_i/_n), and increments past occupied names. The reserved source #_a_accessor_storage therefore starts the observed sequence at #_b_accessor_storage."
